25
00:02:18.347 --> 00:02:19.640
Oh, fuck.

26
00:02:19.723 --> 00:02:22.893
Lacy, Lacy.
You gotta take care of Lacy.

27
00:02:22.976 --> 00:02:24.728
- I got it. Don't worry about her. OK?
- Yeah.

28
00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:25.896
- Don't worry about her.
- Yeah.

29
